<title>USA: Cadmus says will buy back up to 750,000 shr.</title>
<headline>Cadmus says will buy back up to 750,000 shr.</headline>
<dateline>RICHMOND, Va 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cadmus Communications Corp said Wednesday its board of directors had authorized the repurchase of up to 750,000 shares of common stock.</p>
<p>The company said the buyback is for about 9 percent of the shares outstanding. The shares will be repurchased in open market or privately negotiated transactions during the next year.</p>
<p>The company said the stock repurchase program should increase earnings per share.</p>
</text>
